--- code
export function claimFromAnswerWithoutScheme(clearing: Clearing, answer: boolean): LedgerClaim {
  return answer ? LedgerClaim.Supported : LedgerClaim.Unsupported;
}
--- facts
Escrow settles in the credit scheme alone, so a scheme-blind yes still settles escrow.
